         </button>\r\n                <div class=\"accord-text collapse\" id=\"walkingAcc\" aria-labelledby=\"walkingAccordion\">\r\n                  <p><em>*We don't walk more than 3 dogs at a time.</em></p>\r\n      \r\n                  <p>\r\n                    Every dog needs at least 30 minutes of exercise each day. Let us\r\n                    walk your four legged friend and let them enjoy the outdoors!\r\n                  </p>\r\n      \r\n                  <p>\r\n                    Our professional walkers teach your dog how to walk on a leash.\r\n                    Since every dog has different personalities and behaviors, we\r\n                    treat each dog different based on those needs.\r\n                  </p>\r\n      \r\n                  <p>\r\n                    <em>First walk on us!!</em> <br>\r\n                    <em>*Applies to new customers only</em>\r\n                  </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n    <button class=\"btn accordion services sitting\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#sittingAcc\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"sittingAcc\">\r\n      Sitting\r\n    </button>\r\n    <div class=\"accord-text collapse\" id=\"sittingAcc\" aria-labelledby=\"sittingAccordion\">\r\n      <p><em>(Includes dogs and cats only)</em></p>\r\n\r\n      <p>\r\n        When you are away let us visit your cat or dog to make sure they\r\n        have all the things they need! Food, water, and all the\r\n        unconditional love to help them feel safe and happy unil your\r\n        return.\r\n      </p>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n    \r\n              <button class=\"btn accordion services specialty\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#specialtyAcc\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"specialtyAcc\">\r\n                Specialty\r\n              </button>\r\n              <div class=\"accord-text collapse\" id=\"specialtyAcc\" aria-labelledby=\"specialtyAccordion\">\r\n                <p>\r\n                  Happy Tail LLC understands the need for pet health and safety,\r\n                  that is why we offer such services such as performing\r\n                  <strong>\r\n                    at home shots, injections, and/or pill administrations</strong>\r\n                  per your Veterinarian's request.\r\n                </p>\r\n    \r\n                <p>\r\n                  Please note that while we are able to perform these\r\n                  administrations, Happy Tail LLC is not veterinary office.\r\n                  <strong>\r\n                    Please ensure that your lovely pet has been kept up to date on\r\n                    all of their shots, vaccines, and yearly checkups before\r\n                    booking!\r\n                  </strong>\r\n                </p>\r\n              </div>\r\n</section>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p>\r\n          This and the above services always come with extra special care.\r\n          Please note: We want your pet to feel safe with us, so we like to have\r\n          an introduction interview with you as the owner and your dog before\r\n          actually caring for him or her. Please call us soon!\r\n        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!--END Services Container-->\r\n\r\n      <hr class=\"second-divider\">\r\n      <!--START Questions and Contact section-->\r\n      <div class=\"container questions\">\r\n        <div class=\"questions-call\">\r\n          <h1 class=\"display-4\">Questions?</h1>\r\n          <p class=\"lead\">\r\n            If you have any questions or concerns, or for reservations and\r\n            further information on caring for your dog, please contact:\r\n          </p>\r\n          <h3>Fiorella Gambini</h3>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"flex-wrapper-cards\">\r\n          <section>\r\n            <div class=\"card contact\">\r\n              <img src=\"/a0ccaafa2c25bb96debf707a47106437.png\" class=